    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n**DNG 3D VIRTUAL TOUR OF THIS PROPERTY AVAILABLE**\n\nDNG are delighted to present to the market 2 Stocking Well Close, Stocking Avenue, Rathfarnham, Dublin 16. \n\nThis stylish and spacious two-bedroom, own-door ground floor apartment is presented in pristine turnkey condition and boasts generously proportioned accommodation, complemented by a large private terrace. Set within the mature and peaceful surroundings of Stocking Well, the property is sure to appeal to a wide range of purchasers, including first-time buyers, those looking to downsize and investors alike. \n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises an entrance porch, a bright open-plan living/dining/kitchen area, hallway with useful storage closet, master bedroom with en-suite, second double bedroom and family bathroom. \n\nStocking Well is a mature and popular residential development, enjoying a tranquil setting with expansive views towards the Dublin Mountains while remaining within easy reach of a host of amenities. There is an excellent selection of shopping centres, primary and secondary schools and recreational facilities nearby, while the M50 network is also easily accessible. The area is well served by public transport, with numerous bus routes providing convenient access to Dublin city centre and surrounding areas."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - 2.46m x 1.30m\nWelcoming space with tiled flooring\n\nLiving/Dining Room - 5.00m x 4.96m\nVery bright open plan space with tiled floor and direct access to terrace area via sliding doors\n\nKitchen - 3.16m x 1.90m\nFully fitted kitchen with tiled floor and bay window overlooking green area\n\nStorage Room - 1.06m x 1.95m\n\n\nHallway - 3.77m x 0.89m\n\n\nBathroom - 1.52m x 1.95m\nFully tiled with WC, WHB & bath\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.35m x 2.62m\nWith built-in wardrobes\n\nEn-suite Bathroom - 1.27m x 1.95m\nWith WC, WHB and shower; fully tiled\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.08m x 2.24m\nWith built-in wardrobes\n\nPrivate Terrace - \nAccessible directly from living area\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Management Fees 1,050 per annum</li><li> Impressive two-bedroom, two-bathroom own-door ground floor apartment</li><li> Presented in pristine turnkey condition</li><li> Tri-aspect apartment</li><li> Private terrace</li><li> Well-proportioned accommodation throughout</li><li> Modern gas-fired central heating</li><li> Double-glazed windows</li><li> Built-in wardrobes</li><li> Designated car parking space with visitor parking available</li><li> Well-managed residential development</li><li> Excellent location close to a wide range of shops, schools and public transport</li><li> Extra storage unit</li><li> M50 motorway only a short drive away</ul>"
      },
